sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant C as Client
    participant A as Auth Server
    participant R as Resource
    U->>C: Login
    C->>A: Authorization Request
    A->>U: Login Prompt
    U->>A: Credentials
    A-->>C: Auth Code
    C->>A: Exchange Code
    A-->>C: Access Token
    C->>R: Request + Token
    R-->>C: Protected Data
    C-->>U: Dashboard
